From: pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
Subject: Neo draws the task view: drag progress and window list over D-Bus

In Neo mode Phosh no longer shows its own cards or the big drag thumbnail.
de.yesman.PhoshNeo gains the signals RecentsDrag(progress), RecentsHold and
RecentsEnd("home"|"recents"), and the methods GetWindows (id, app id, title,
raw ARGB32 thumbnail on the runtime dir, size, stride, focused), Activate,
Close and CloseAll.
